              19                     
              20                       ! -------------> ldland included for AMIP2 !!
              21                     
              22                       ! Description:
              23                       !
              24                       ! Master routine for cumulus massfluxscheme
              25                       !
              26                       ! Method:
              27                       !
              28                       ! This routine computes the physical tendencies of the
              29                       ! prognostic variables t,q,u and v due to convective processes.
              30                       ! Processes considered are:
              31                       !    Convective fluxes,
              32                       !    formation of precipitation,
              33                       !    evaporation of falling rain below cloud base,
              34                       !    saturated cumulus downdrafts.
              35                       !
              36                       ! *cumastr* is called from *cucall*.
              37                       ! The routine takes its input from the long-term storage
              38                       ! t,q,u,v,phi and p and moisture tendencies.
              39                       ! It returns its output to the same space
              40                       !   1. modified tendencies of model variables
              41                       !   2. rates of convective precipitation (used in subroutine surf)
              42                       !
              43                       ! Parameterization is done using a massflux-scheme.
              44                       ! (1) Define constants and parameters.
              45                       ! (2) Specify values (t,q,qs.) at half levels and
              46                       !     initialize updraft- and downdraft-values in 'cuini'.
              47                       ! (3) Calculate cloud base in 'cubase'.
              48                       !     and specify cloud base massflux from pbl moisture budget
              49                       ! (4) Do cloud ascent in 'cuasc' in absence of downdrafts.
              50                       ! (5) Do downdraft calculations:
              51                       !     (a) Determine values at lfs in 'cudlfs'.
              52                       !     (b) Determine moist descent in 'cuddraf'.
              53                       !     (c) Decalculate cloud base massflux considering the
              54                       !         effect of cu-downdrafts.
              55                       ! (6) Do final cloud ascent in 'cuasc'.
              56                       ! (7) Do final adjusments to convective fluxes in 'cuflx',
              57                       !     do evaporation in subcloud layer.
              58                       ! (8) Calculate increments of t and q in 'cudtdq'.
              59                       ! (9) Calculate increments of u and v in 'cududv'.
              60                       !
              61                       ! Externals:
              62                       !
              63                       ! cuini:  initializes values at vertical grid used in cu-parametr.
              64                       ! cubase: cloud base calculation for penetr.and shallow convection
              65                       ! cuasc:  cloud ascent for entraining plume
              66                       ! cudlfs: determines values at lfs for downdrafts
              67                       ! cuddraf:does moist descent for cumulus downdrafts
              68                       ! cuflx:  final adjustments to convective fluxes (also in pbl)
              69                       ! cudqdt: updates tendencies for t and q
              70                       ! cududv: updates tendencies for u and v
              71                       !
              72                       ! Switches:
              73                       ! lmfpen=.t.   penetrative convection is switched on
              74                       ! lmfscv=.t.   shallow convection is switched on
              75                       ! lmfmid=.t.   midlevel convection is switched on
              76                       ! lmfdd=.t.    cumulus downdrafts switched on
              77                       ! lmfdudv=.t.  cumulus friction switched on
              78                       !
              79                       ! model parameters (defined in subroutine cuparam):
              80                       ! entrpen    entrainment rate for penetrative convection
              81                       ! entrscv    entrainment rate for shallow convection
              82                       ! entrmid    entrainment rate for midlevel convection
              83                       ! entrdd     entrainment rate for cumulus downdrafts
              84                       ! cmfctop    relative cloud massflux at level above nonbuoyancy leve
              85                       ! cmfcmax    maximum massflux value allowed for
              86                       ! cmfcmin    minimum massflux value (for safety)
              87                       ! cmfdeps    fractional massflux for downdrafts at lfs
              88                       ! cprcon     coefficient for conversion from cloud water to rain
              89                       !
              90                       ! Paper on massflux scheme (tiedtke,1989)
              91                       !
              92                       ! Authors:
              93                       !
              94                       ! M. Tiedtke, ECMWF, in 1986, 1987, and 1989, original source
              95                       ! L. Kornblueh, MPI, May 1998, f90 rewrite
              96                       ! U. Schulzweida, MPI, May 1998, f90 rewrite
              97                       !
              98                       ! for more details see file AUTHORS
              99                       !
             100                     
             101                       USE shr_kind_mod, only: r8 => shr_kind_r8
             102                     ! USE time_manager,     only: is_first_step          ! initial run
             103                       USE mo_constants,     only: rd,      &! gas constant for dry air
             104                                                   c4les,   &!
             105                                                   c5les,   &!
             106                                                   cpd,     &! specific heat at constant pressure
             107                                                   g,       &! gravity acceleration
             108                                                   vtmpc1,  &! vtmpc1=rv/rd-1
             109                                                   alv       ! latent heat for vaporisation
             110                       USE mo_cumulus_flux,  only: lmfdudv, &! true if cum. friction is switched on
             111                                                   cmfdeps, &! fractional massflux for downdr. at lfs
             112                                                   lmfdd,   &! true if cum. downdraft is switched on
             113                                                   entrpen, &! entrainment rate for penetrative conv.
             114                                                   entrscv   ! entrainment rate for shallow conv.
             115                     
             116                       IMPLICIT NONE
             117                     
